# Accessibility statement

This statement covers {{ project_name }} at [{{ site_url | regex_replace('^https://', '') }}]({{ site_url }}).
{{ author_name }} builds and maintains it, and is responsible for this statement.

## Using {{ project_name }}

You should be able to:

- use it on a screen 320 px wide, or zoomed in to 400%, without scrolling sideways;
- use a dark theme, which follows your system setting.

